{"title": "Manoeuvring Attack (Ranged)", "pageid": 14402, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Manoeuvring_Attack_(Ranged)", "categories": ["Weapon actions", "Ranged weapon attacks", "Actions", "Combat manoeuvres"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">This article is about the ranged version of the attack. For the melee version, see <a href=\"/wiki/Manoeuvring_Attack_(Melee)\" title=\"Manoeuvring Attack (Melee)\">Manoeuvring Attack (Melee)</a>.   </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Manoeuvring_Attack_Ranged.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/52/Manoeuvring_Attack_Ranged.webp/300px-Manoeuvring_Attack_Ranged.webp, /w/images/5/52/Manoeuvring_Attack_Ranged.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/52/Manoeuvring_Attack_Ranged.webp/300px-Manoeuvring_Attack_Ranged.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/52/Manoeuvring_Attack_Ranged.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Manoeuvring Attack (Ranged)</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Battle_Master\" title=\"Battle Master\">Battle Master</a> weapon action. After landing this melee attack, the Battle Master can grant an ally bonus <a href=\"/wiki/Movement_speed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Movement speed\">movement speed</a> and immunity to <a href=\"/wiki/Opportunity_Attack\" title=\"Opportunity Attack\">opportunity attacks</a> for one turn.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nAttack an enemy. On a hit, you can use <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Forced_Manoeuvre\" title=\"Forced Manoeuvre\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/78/Forced_Manoeuvre_Icon.webp/20px-Forced_Manoeuvre_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/78/Forced_Manoeuvre_Icon.webp/30px-Forced_Manoeuvre_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/78/Forced_Manoeuvre_Icon.webp/40px-Forced_Manoeuvre_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Forced Manoeuvre\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/78/Forced_Manoeuvre_Icon.webp/20px-Forced_Manoeuvre_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/78/Forced_Manoeuvre_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Forced_Manoeuvre\" title=\"Forced Manoeuvre\">Forced Manoeuvre</a> on an ally, increasing their movement speed.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a></dd>\n<dt>Cost on hit</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Superiority_Die_d8_Icon.png/25px-Superiority_Die_d8_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/Superiority_Die_d8_Icon.png/38px-Superiority_Die_d8_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/9/9f/Superiority_Die_d8_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Superiority_Die_d8_Icon.png/25px-Superiority_Die_d8_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/9/9f/Superiority_Die_d8_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Superiority_Die\" title=\"Superiority Die\">Superiority Die</a></dd><dt>Damage</dt><dd class=\"bg3wiki-damage-display\" style=\"margin-left:0px\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;width:fit-content\"><div><div style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Normal weapon damage</div><div style=\"white-space:nowrap\"> + <span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Superiority_Die_d8_Icon.png/25px-Superiority_Die_d8_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/Superiority_Die_d8_Icon.png/38px-Superiority_Die_d8_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/9/9f/Superiority_Die_d8_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Superiority Die d8 Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Superiority_Die_d8_Icon.png/25px-Superiority_Die_d8_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/9/9f/Superiority_Die_d8_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Battlemaster#Superiority_dice\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Battlemaster\">Superiority Die</a></div></div></div></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ranged Weapon Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Ranged Weapon <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Roll</a></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: Normal weapon range\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: Normal weapon range</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"At_higher_levels\"> At higher levels </span></h2>\n<p>At level 10 with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Improved_Combat_Superiority\" title=\"Improved Combat Superiority\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Generic_Damage_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Damage_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Generic_Damage_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Damage_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Generic_Damage_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Damage_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Improved Combat Superiority\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Generic_Damage_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Damage_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Generic_Damage_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Improved_Combat_Superiority\" ti